{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「惡靈古堡 安魂曲」榮獲GOTY！英國歷史性獎項「Golden Joystick Awards 2026」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/69c1df7ece26835f8e6ea8b7992048583f162bfc8782d3d450055f8084b1650c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb315e472efa1110d04a088e0f0232bef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「惡靈古堡 安魂曲」榮獲GOTY！英國歷史性獎項「Golden Joystick Awards 2026」</figcaption></figure><p>2026年11月12日(四)，國際遊戲獎項「<strong>Golden Joystick Awards 2026</strong>」公布了得獎作品。<br/>相當於最優秀獎的「<strong>Ultimate Game of the Year</strong>」由「<strong>惡靈古堡 安魂曲</strong>」獲選。</p><h2>「惡靈古堡 安魂曲」榮獲「Ultimate Game of the Year」！</h2><figure><img alt=\"Ultimate Game of the Year\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4d9856dfb16cfabc853d3d98ee8237ff6b0c36ad7bde699a4c591303b9ddd025/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdc45196bebca3a8cc104f47ef65113cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Ultimate Game of the Year</figcaption></figure><p>「<a href=\"https://www.gamesradar.com/goldenjoystickawards/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Joystick Awards 2026</a>」是由遊戲記者等選出入圍作品，再經全世界遊戲粉絲的一般投票決定各部門得獎作品的獎項。<br/>相當於最優秀獎的「<strong>Ultimate Game of the Year</strong>」由「<strong>惡靈古堡 安魂曲</strong>」獲選。</p><p></p><p>此外，惡靈古堡 安魂曲除Ultimate Game of the Year之外，也在以下部門獲獎。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><ul><li><p>Console Game of the Year</p></li><li><p>Best Game Trailer(以同作為題材的短篇真人影像「<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bjKFjfI1AOI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">那具屍體也曾有名字</a>」)</p></li><li><p>Best Lead Performer(Angela Sant'Albano(<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/angelasantalbano/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@angelasantalbano</a>)以Grace一角獲獎)</p></li></ul><figure><img alt=\"Studio of the Year\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2882c2ea008044dc67fa48e49064a2e44d7a3f74fb42293dc704fa2b1ca83810/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa8cd625a8080d9dfd07160a094d46432.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Studio of the Year</figcaption></figure><p>除此之外，與「惡靈古堡 安魂曲」開發商卡普空相關，也獲頒以下獎項。</p><ul><li><p>Studio of the Year(卡普空)</p></li><li><p>Best Audio Design(<a href=\"https://www.capcom-games.com/onimusha/ws/ja-jp/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鬼武者 Way of the Sword</a>)</p></li><li><p>Best Supporting Performer(於<a href=\"https://www.capcom-games.com/pragmata/ja-jp/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PRAGMATA</a>飾演Diana的Grace Saif(<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/grace.saif/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@grace.saif</a>))</p></li></ul><h3>獨立遊戲「超級變色龍」榮獲共4個獎項！</h3><figure><img alt=\"Best Indie Game - Self-Published\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/29c3ec1a19db0ad81d79f0506158c6523208b86afa4fba9fcb546d40a70bbe37/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1fb1ce36b6c0f5438fa32c8902cc140e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Best Indie Game - Self-Published</figcaption></figure><p>結合繪畫與捉迷藏的對戰遊戲「<a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4704690/%E3%82%81%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%82%AB%E3%83%A1%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AA%E3%83%B3/?l=japanese\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">超級變色龍</a>」也榮獲以下4個獎項。</p><ul><li><p>Best Indie Game - Self-Published</p></li><li><p>Best Multiplayer Game</p></li><li><p>Developers' Choice</p></li><li><p>Streamers' Choice</p></li></ul><p>各部門得獎作品請於Golden Joysticks官方X(<a href=\"https://x.com/GoldenJoysticks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@GoldenJoysticks</a>)確認。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>The Golden Joystick Awards' most-prestigious award of all - Ultimate Game of the Year - goes to the phenomenal Resident Evil Requiem!</p><p>HUGE congratulations to <a href=\"https://x.com/CapcomEurope?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@CapcomEurope</a> and <a href=\"https://x.com/RE_Games?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@RE_Games</a> 🎉(We hope the Umbrella Corporation doesn't try to take credit for this.)… <a href=\"https://t.co/EKMMENxrQS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/EKMMENxrQS</a></p><p>— Golden Joysticks (@GoldenJoysticks) <a href=\"https://x.com/GoldenJoysticks/status/2120609905790926930?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 11, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/street-fighter-league-americas-2026-final-2game-victory/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「快打旋風聯賽 AMERICAS 2026」由「2GAME」奪冠！取得世界大賽參賽資格</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/streetfighter2-mcdonalds-cheese-cheese-series-collaboration/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「快打II」與麥當勞「雙層芝士」系列合作！「RYU」VS「LUNA CHEE」的對戰影片公開</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/capcomcup13-sfl2026-final-ticket-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「CAPCOM CUP 13」「SFL 世界冠軍賽 2026」會場觀賽門票開始先到先得販售！11月9日日本時間19:00起販賣</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/desktopmate-streetfighter-6-dlc-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Desktop Mate《快打旋風6》隆、春麗 DLC登場！11月12日起正式發售</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/1kuji-streetfighter-6-vol2-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸一番賞「一番賞 快打旋風6 vol.2」將於2027年3月13日發售！肯、JP、艾德公仔登場！</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:04:06.150932+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1573,"images":4,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:37:37.326346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T08:57:25.594044+00:00","content_hash":"08e5542ec3438060a54ecfeae7098d9e2f9156a38ac842eac62e70d3d47f1f8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}